Feature: Telemetry on the TX15
  The flight computer sends the state of the plane back down the serial line. The TX15 shows
  it on its screen, as it does for any plane with an ExpressLRS receiver.

  Expectation: The TX15 shows the flight mode
    Given the TX15 screen mode is RTL
    When 5 seconds pass
    Then the TX15 screen mode is RTL

  Expectation: The TX15 shows when the plane is armed
    Given the TX15 screen arming is armed
    When 5 seconds pass
    Then the TX15 screen arming is armed

  Expectation: The TX15 shows the battery
    Given the TX15 screen battery is 11.1 V
    When 5 seconds pass
    Then the TX15 screen battery is 11.1 V

  Expectation: The TX15 shows the bank
    Given the TX15 screen bank is 30 degrees
    When 5 seconds pass
    Then the TX15 screen bank is 30 degrees
